# --- secrets / personal ---
# Personal play guide (which mods James runs + how he uses them) — local-only by request
# (2026-08-24); the public repo documents the port, not the playstyle.
MODS-GUIDE.md
# Personal Claude Code workflow rules, auto-synced into every repo from ~/.claude on session
# start. Deliberately NOT published here (decided 2026-08-24): this repo is public, and these are
# private working conventions, not project documentation. They regenerate automatically, so
# nothing is lost by excluding them. Never tracked — this entry keeps a stray `git add .` honest.
.claude/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
credentials*
*session*.json
*sessionId*
.pdxsdk/
connection_log*.txt

# --- screenshots & captures (may contain account names, library, desktop) ---
# Deliberately excluded: screenshots have historically carried account names. Images intended for
# the docs are opted in explicitly, one path at a time, after being eyeballed for personal info.
*.png
!docs/images/*.png
!docs/images/*.jpg
*.jpg
*.jpeg
login*.png
qr*.png

# --- game / wine artifacts (large, machine-specific, or copyrighted) ---
*.dll
*.exe
*.bak
*.coc
*.dxvk-cache
*.dmp
dumps/
Player.log
*.log
# Steam writes its own logs into the CWD, and the cell harness runs Steam with the repo as CWD,
# so logs/webhelper.txt appears here after any render cell. Runtime artifact, never project
# content — it was committed once by accident (4ec10b6, clean of personal info) and untracked.
logs/

prefix/
Bottles/

# --- build / tooling ---
revenv/
scratchpad/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# --- os ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
Icon?
